  "description": {
   "en": "He was reincarnated as Luke Wizalia Gilbert, a hated villainous noble who, due to his overwhelming talent, would eventually be defeated by the protagonist in a \"serves you right\" moment. The only way to avoid this disastrous end is... \"hard work\"!! By defying fate, Luke gradually captivates the beautiful and talented daughters of prestigious families, and even attracts shadowy figures with hidden powers who were never meant to be involved, as well as the heroine who was supposed to side with the protagonist...",
   "ja": "“破滅エンド”を避けるため、 傲慢すぎる悪役は“努力”した。嫌われ者の悪役貴族に転生してしまった俺は、「努力」だけを武器にして打倒主人公を目指すーー!!"
  },
